{"item_uid": "學測94-social-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "孫中山先生為合理解決資本問題，提倡節制私人資本，在他所擬訂的辦法中，\n哪一項牽涉到勞工權益的維護？", "options": {"A": "限制私人企業經營之範圍", "B": "社會與工業之改良", "C": "直接徵稅", "D": "分配社會化"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C（或A）", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 23.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 34.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 37.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 41.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 24.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 37.0, "p_low": 20.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [41.0, 29.0, 22.0, 19.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "一位老師在介紹一本孫中山先生的著作時，說到：「這本書提倡知難行易，破\n除『知之非艱，行之惟艱』的流毒，有助於國人革除『坐而言不能起而行』的\n積習，養成嚴謹勤勞、振奮進取的心性。」請問這本書為何？", "options": {"A": "孫文學說", "B": "實業計畫", "C": "民權初步", "D": "建國大綱"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 42.0, "B": 33.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 62.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 26.0, "B": 36.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 62.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 50.0, 38.0, 29.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "台灣地區已逐漸成為一高齡化社會，老年人口比例逐年攀升，為落實民生主義\n「養民」的目的，下列哪些措施，有助於達成「老有所終」的理想？\n甲、恢復傳統大家庭的制度\n乙、制定妥善的老人福利政策\n丙、鼓勵三代同堂或三代同鄰\n丁、老人年金發放年齡降至五十歲", "options": {"A": "甲、乙", "B": "乙、丙", "C": "丙、丁", "D": "甲、丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 96.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 99.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 90.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 96.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 90.0, "discrimination": 9.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 99.0, 97.0, 85.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "近年來政府積極敦促中船、中油、台糖、台鐵等國營事業轉型為民營事業，這\n項政策最主要的著眼點為何？", "options": {"A": "提升經營效率", "B": "因應台幣升值", "C": "創造就業機會", "D": "培植基礎工業"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 79.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 96.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 55.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 55.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 92.0, 86.0, 73.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "政府將致力於憲政改革，今後憲政體制無論是採行內閣制、總統制、雙首長制\n或五權憲法制，都必須落實憲政民主的精神。下列何者最符合憲政民主精神？", "options": {"A": "落實主權在民，各項爭議都訴諸公民投票解決", "B": "防止民代濫權，擴大行政部門職權制衡立法權", "C": "實施有限政府，各部門權責依據分權原理設計", "D": "採用赤字財政，涉及民眾福利者皆應優先處理"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 63.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 7.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 41.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 34.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 80.0, 70.0, 52.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "全民健保實施以來，造福不少貧困家庭，但也有人質疑，國家強制人民參加健\n保、繳交保費，有侵犯憲法保障之人民財產權的嫌疑。事實上，大法官會議曾\n作出解釋：全民健保強制入保的作法，符合公共利益並不構成違憲。針對此一\n議題，下列哪些主張可能會被用來支持大法官會議的觀點？\n甲、保障社會安全是國家發展的方針\n乙、尊重私人財產但不允許資本壟斷\n丙、促進民族健康為國家施政的原則\n丁、人權的保障應依國家需要而限縮", "options": {"A": "甲、乙", "B": "乙、丁", "C": "甲、丙", "D": "丙、丁\n- 1 -\n94學年度 第 2 頁\n社會考科 共 14 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 24.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 67.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 67.0, "discrimination": 2.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 66.0, 66.0, 67.0, 67.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "孫中山先生是當代著名的政治家，由於出生地理環境的關係，使他可以用不一\n樣的角度思考中國的問題。請問下列何者為其出生地所具有的最重要優勢？", "options": {"A": "地處政治中樞，接近政治權力的中心", "B": "位處沿海地區，有機會接觸外來資訊", "C": "隸屬外國殖民地，不受清廷權力管轄", "D": "地屬偏遠，因此得以免受戰火之波及"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 8.0, "B": 76.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 56.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 76.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 56.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 88.0, 81.0, 72.0, 47.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "台灣近年來失業率較以往上升，引起政府的高度重視，因為失業問題往往會引\n發其他的社會問題，下列何者是政府在面對失業問題時，最可能關注的重點？", "options": {"A": "造成物價上漲，進而引發通貨膨脹", "B": "造成人口外移，雇主被迫引進外勞", "C": "佔用大量社會福利資源而耗盡國庫", "D": "造成犯罪率上升因而危及社會治安"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 77.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 83.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 67.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 77.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 67.0, "discrimination": 16.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 81.0, 80.0, 76.0, 62.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測94-social-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分(佔84分)", "stem": "相對於歐美國家的憲政體制設計，我國的監察院是較為特殊的機構，依據我國\n現行憲法規定，下列有關監察院的定位、監察委員的產生及其職權的敘述，何\n者正確？", "options": {"A": "P1和P2有各自的服務範圍，彼此並不重疊", "B": "P1和P2的服務範圍以各自為中心，均衡地向四周圍擴展", "C": "P1的服務人口大於P2", "D": "所有運輸幹線都是因為都市之間高度需求而新近興建\n圖5\n- 6 -\n第 7 頁 94學年度\n共 14 頁 社會考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 18.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 64.0, "D": 15.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 18.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 64.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [69.0, 54.0, 47.0, 44.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
